      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اجتزعهُ</span></b>  <i>He broke it,</i> and <i>cut it off:</i> (K:)
or <i>he broke it off,</i> and <i>cut it off, for himself;</i>
namely, a branch, rod, or piece of wood, from a
tree. (S.)

